### KNX Controllers (internal Web API)
### Base URL is the Haus application server
### Covers: Bus, Hvac, Lights, PowerOutlets, Shutters
# Group/address names below are synthetic. Select existing names from the read endpoints before sending commands.

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv HAUS_BASE_URL}}

###
### ── Bus Controller ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### Get all group addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/addresses
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get group addresses (filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/addresses?groupAddressFilter=Active
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Filter group addresses by criteria
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/addresses/filter?category=LI&floor=EG
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get group addresses grouped
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/addresses/grouped
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get raw group addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/addresses/raw
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List floors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/floors
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/rooms
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get all KNX state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/state
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Validate a group address
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/validate/address/EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL-SW
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Validate a group name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/validate/group/EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Send command to KNX bus
# @note Sends a command to the KNX bus and can change a physical actuator.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bus/state/send
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupAddressName": "EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL-SW",
  "actualValue": "True"
}

###
### ── HVAC Controller ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### List all HVAC zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hvac
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List HVAC zones by room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hvac?room=LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get a specific HVAC zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hvac/EG-HZ-LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Set HVAC state
# @note Queues or sends a KNX heating setpoint change for the selected zone.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hvac
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-HZ-LivingRoom",
  "setpointAdjust": 21.0
}

### Set HVAC state (dry run)
# @note Resolves the proposed heating change without queuing or sending KNX commands.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hvac?dryRun=true
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-HZ-LivingRoom",
  "setpointAdjust": 21.0
}

###
### ── Lights Controller ───────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### List all lights
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List lights by room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights?room=LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get a specific light
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights/EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Set light state (on)
# @note Queues or sends a KNX command to turn the selected light on.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights/state
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL",
  "isOn": true
}

### Set light state (dry run)
# @note Resolves the proposed lighting change without queuing or sending KNX commands.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights/state?dryRun=true
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-LI-LivingRoom-DL",
  "isOn": true
}

### Turn all lights off
# @note Turns off all eligible KNX lights, not just the example room.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lights/state/all-off
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

###
### ── Power Outlets Controller ────────────────────────────────────────
###

### List all power outlets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/poweroutlets
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List power outlets by room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/poweroutlets?room=LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get a specific power outlet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/poweroutlets/EG-SD-LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Set power outlet state
# @note Queues or sends a KNX command to energize the selected power outlet.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/poweroutlets/state
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-SD-LivingRoom",
  "isOn": true
}

### Set power outlet state (dry run)
# @note Resolves the proposed outlet change without queuing or sending KNX commands.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/poweroutlets/state?dryRun=true
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-SD-LivingRoom",
  "isOn": true
}

###
### ── Shutters Controller ─────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### List all shutters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### List shutters by room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters?room=LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Get a specific shutter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters/EG-BL-LivingRoom
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Set shutter state
# @note Queues or sends a KNX command that physically moves the selected shutter.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters/state
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-BL-LivingRoom",
  "vPosition": 50
}

### Set shutter state (dry run)
# @note Resolves the proposed shutter change without queuing or sending KNX commands.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters/state?dryRun=true
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupName": "EG-BL-LivingRoom",
  "vPosition": 50
}

### Close all shutters
# @note Physically closes all eligible KNX shutters, not just the example room.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters/state/all-close
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}

### Open all shutters
# @note Physically opens all eligible KNX shutters, not just the example room.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shutters/state/all-open
Authorization: Basic {{$dotenv HAUS_API_AUTH}}
